<title>UK: Hypo in Hamburg prices 1.0 billion mark bond.</title>
<headline>Hypo in Hamburg prices 1.0 billion mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    01.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.37     PAY DATE  S-29.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    98.18     SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    11 BP     SELL CONC  19 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MARCH 2004 TREHUND  NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.    PFANDBRIEF SERIES 990</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
